  "stem": "<p>In <math alttext=\"triangle upper X upper Y upper Z\"><mo>&#9651;</mo><mi>X</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>Z</mi></math>, the measure of <math alttext=\"angle upper X\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>X</mi></math><em> </em>is <math alttext=\"23 degree\"><mn>23</mn>\n<mo>&#176;</mo></math> and the measure of <math alttext=\"angle upper Y\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>Y</mi></math><em> </em>is <math alttext=\"66 degree\"><mn>66</mn>\n<mo>&#176;</mo></math>. What is the measure of <math alttext=\"angle upper Z\"><mo>&#8736;</mo><mi>Z</mi></math>?</p>",
